@startuml
' ============================================================
' 拉格朗日AI — PlantUML 时序图
' 渲染：plantuml sequence.puml
' ============================================================

title 拉格朗日AI — AI对话流程

actor 用户 as User
participant "前端SPA" as Frontend
participant "FastAPI" as API
participant "FAISS向量库" as RAG
participant "DeepSeek API" as AI
database "SQLite" as DB

User -> Frontend: 输入问题"光追级防空能力如何？"
Frontend -> API: POST /api/chat (JWT鉴权)

activate API

API -> DB: 查询用户Token余额
DB --> API: 余额: 8500

alt 余额不足
  API --> Frontend: 402 余额不足
  Frontend -> User: 弹出充值提示
else 余额充足
  API -> RAG: 检索相关文档
  RAG --> API: Top-5 相关片段 [战斗机制.txt]
  
  API -> API: 构建系统提示词\n(游戏知识+检索结果)
  
  API -> AI: DeepSeek Chat API\n(system prompt + 用户问题)
  AI --> API: AI回复 + Token用量
  
  API -> DB: 扣减Token\n保存对话记录
  DB --> API: 扣减成功
  
  API --> Frontend: ChatResponse\n(answer + sourceDocs + tokens)
  Frontend -> User: 显示AI回复\n标注资料来源
end

deactivate API

@enduml
